Maintainer: Marcel Hüttenberger <papachaotica@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: storebackup-on-nfs-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, storebackup, nfs-common, iputils-ping, ethtool
Recommends: wakeonlan
Description: Generic guarded StoreBackup client for NFS backup servers
 Replace the daily storebackup with an hourly script that checks if an NFS
 server is reachable and stores the backup there—likewise only on a daily
 basis. After 7 days without a successful backup (configurable), the server
 is woken up via Wake-on-LAN.
